### Common Errors in Your Code

```python
plt.lib(x,y)
```

✅ Correct:

```python
plt.plot(x,y)
```

```python
plt.scatter(x,y)
```

✅ Correct:

```python
plt.scatter(x1,y1)
```

These are the two fixes needed for your code to run properly.
